Package: storyline
Title: Reading Orders for Země v roce 40 000
Version: 0.1.0
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Authors@R: person("Petr", "Tureček", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "petr.turecek@natur.cuni.cz")
Author: Petr Tureček [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Petr Tureček <petr.turecek@natur.cuni.cz>
Description: Provides chronological, kairological, and reproducibly randomized
    chapter contents for the fiction book Země v roce 40 000. Optional chapter
    labels and openings can be printed and written as UTF-8 tab-separated text.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/costlysignalling/storyline
BugReports: https://github.com/costlysignalling/storyline/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
